# EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant — Project Testing

 ## 1\. Testing Overview

 Testing is an important phase of the **EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant** project. The main objective is to verify that all modules work correctly, AI responses are handled properly, user data is protected, and the application provides a reliable learning experience.

 Testing covers the **frontend, backend, database, Gemini API integration, authentication, quiz generation, summarization, and progress tracking**.

 ## 2\. Testing Objectives

 The main objectives are:

 - Verify that all functional requirements are implemented correctly.
- Ensure users can register and log in successfully.
- Verify communication between the frontend and backend.
- Verify integration with Google Gemini.
- Check the accuracy and relevance of generated educational content.
- Test quiz generation and scoring.
- Test study-material summarization.
- Verify learning-history and progress features.
- Identify and fix application errors.
- Test security and input validation.
- Evaluate usability and performance.

